CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'state->bpp == 32'
#95: FILE: drivers/video/fbdev/nvidia/nvidia.c:180:
+		if (((par->Chipset & 0xffff) == 0x0328) && (state->bpp == 32)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

